<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Larova · English base strings. This is the single source of truth.

  Never edit a translated file to fix wording. Fix the English and re-translate,
  or the languages drift apart. See docs/localization.md.

  Rules:
    · No string concatenation in code.
    · Placeholders are always positional (%1$s), because word order changes.
    · Counts use <plurals>. Polish, Russian and Arabic have more than two forms.
-->
